1
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:01,760
Dad.

2
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,480
The house has been sealed.

3
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,140
You'll have to make do for now.

4
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:06,680
Jinwen.

5
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,760
Although I've caught the drug smuggler,

6
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,039
the mastermind is still at large.

7
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,560
If your spirits are watching from above,

8
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,620
please help me find the real culprit.

9
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,560
This roll of film came in a strange way.

10
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,620
It's not evidence.

11
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,240
I can only ask for your help.

12
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:45,160
German-made.

13
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,360
This is Leica's new 35mm film.

14
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,840
It's very expensive,

15
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,600
so it's extremely rare in the country.

16
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,930
What exactly is in here?

17
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,479
Want to know?

18
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:55,330
Don't worry.

19
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,140
I'll handle it for you.

20
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,500
Come find me tomorrow.

21
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:00,840
Ningning.

22
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,280
What did Bai Xianming say before he died?

23
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,760
He only said the word "hospital".

24
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:06,720
Hospital?

25
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,000
I think Bai Xianming just wanted

26
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,360
to be rushed to the hospital.

27
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,360
Not necessarily.

28
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,800
He probably meant

29
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:15,400
St. George's Hospital in the British Concession.

30
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,760
Our last visit to St. George's Hospital

31
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,760
might have alerted them.

32
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,600
How should we proceed with the case?

33
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,810
Superintendent Li,

34
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,240
we've known each other for seven years.

35
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,800
When I first came to Phoenix Police Academy,

36
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:38,000
you were the one who showed me the ropes.

37
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,280
I've always seen you as my senior.

38
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,079
Just say what you want to say.

39
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:44,680
Don't beat around the bush.

40
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,760
I remember you used to be a good cop.

41
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,600
While apprehending suspects,

42
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:53,760
you stayed on the front lines even after being shot.

43
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,640
What exactly are you trying to say?

44
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,760
As far as I know,

45
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,200
this banned drug smuggling case

46
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:00,460
is being watched by many big shots above.

47
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:03,480
It has some connection to the suburban bone pile case.

48
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,560
If you turn back now,

49
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,800
it's still not too late.

50
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,800
Jiang Siyao, what do you mean?

51
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,960
You're an excellent detective,

52
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,480
and I'm the corrupt cop?

53
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,480
What are you doing?

54
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,760
Police.

55
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,610
Have you seen the girl in the photo?

56
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,240
No.

57
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,100
You've seen this girl,

58
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,960
haven't you?

59
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,880
I said I haven't seen her.

60
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,800
Let's check somewhere else.

61
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,130
Can't you speak nicely?

62
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,090
Let's go, Ningning.

63
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,880
The church symbol behind the girl in the photo

64
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,440
is exactly the same as the one here.

65
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:07,280
This Lei Lie is really a wolf in sheep's clothing.

66
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,080
Jiang Siyao.

67
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,210
I'm telling you,

68
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,680
either you kill me,

69
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,000
or you let me go.

70
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,279
Stop wasting time.

71
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,959
I traveled all over when I was young.

72
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,360
I've seen it all.

73
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,560
Bring it on if you have the guts.

74
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,600
If I make a sound,

75
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:25,040
I'll take your last name.

76
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,240
Lei Lie,

77
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,120
you probably don't know yet.

78
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,400
This case is now

79
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,800
personally supervised by the central special envoy.

80
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:34,159
The person behind you not only can't protect you,

81
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:36,440
but actually hopes you won't say a word.

82
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,020
You'd better think carefully

83
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:42,040
about how they can guarantee you won't say a word.

84
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,040
Do you think

85
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,770
you have much time left to live?

86
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,600
Have you seen this photo?

87
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,480
This person.

88
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,560
Never seen him.

89
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,960
I'll give you one last chance.

90
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,290
Are you going to talk

91
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,760
or not?

92
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,240
Ye Shian, are you crazy?

93
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,040
Do you know you're still injured?

94
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,370
Why did you call us here?

95
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,880
I'm all better.

96
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,880
If I don't catch this bad guy,

97
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:30,040
and find out what happened to my brothers,

98
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,360
I won't have a day of peace.

99
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,890
Besides,

100
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,680
I found out that the girl in the photo,

101
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,840
who was assaulted,

102
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:37,400
worked here half a year ago

103
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,890
and then suddenly quit.

104
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,600
I suspect it has something to do with that incident.

105
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,760
Maybe we can find some clues here.

106
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:47,360
I wonder which gentleman is looking for me.

107
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,420
Boss, I want to ask you about someone.

108
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,010
Do you know this person?

109
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,480
Why are you looking for her?

110
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,159
What happened to her?

111
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,840
This girl

112
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,240
is a jinx.

113
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,700
Since she came, my business has been bad.

114
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:05,000
She either slacked off or served the wrong dishes.

115
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,530
She was always distracted.

116
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,600
By the way,

117
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,960
every time she saw foreigners coming to eat,

118
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,880
she would scream like she was possessed

119
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:12,960
and hide.

120
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,360
I think

121
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,960
she just wanted to slack off

122
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,360
and didn't want to work.

123
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,000
So I sent her away.

124
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:21,560
Could it be that the people here bullied her?

125
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,960
What do you mean by that, miss?

126
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,280
I see you three are not here to eat,

127
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,880
but to pick a fight.

128
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,440
You didn't even ask around where this is.

129
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,600
This is Zuixian Restaurant,

130
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,800
my territory.

131
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,600
Men!

132
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,159
This Zuixian Restaurant is really a shady inn.

133
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:42,159
Kick them out!

134
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,159
You!

135
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:47,290
If you move again, don't blame me for being ruthless.

136
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,400
Be careful with your wound next time.

137
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,159
It's fine. I'm all better.

138
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,100
Why did you come to the missionary hospital?

139
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,760
Where do I pay, doctor?

140
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:03,840
Go out and turn right.

141
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,900
Please take a seat.

142
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,640
Hello, Dr. Peter.

143
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,080
What's bothering you?

144
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,760
I've been having migraines lately.

145
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,880
Can you prescribe some medicine for me?

146
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,080
Of course.

147
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,960
I'll prescribe some medicine for you

148
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,600
to make you feel better.

149
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,080
Doctor,

150
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,560
do you like photography very much?

151
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,200
Yes.

152
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,690
I really like the scenery in China.

153
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,360
Looking at these photos of yours,

154
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,820
they are all so beautiful.

155
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,090
What kind of camera did you use?

156
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,760
Well,

157
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,040
it's not about the camera,

158
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,280
but the film.

159
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,560
I used the latest

160
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,760
Leica 35mm film produced in Germany.

161
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,520
I

162
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,810
brought it all the way from abroad.

163
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:09,010
Is it beautiful?

164
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,040
Beautiful.

165
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,730
Not as beautiful as you.

166
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,000
Thank you.

167
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,840
How is it?

168
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,440
Look inside.

169
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,840
Could it be him?

170
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,200
I'm sure

171
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,760
the photo of the abused girl

172
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,760
was taken by Pete.

173
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,360
What are we waiting for? Let's arrest him.

174
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:33,760
Arrest him.

175
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,120
Wait.

176
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,480
Are you crazy?

177
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,799
This is a hospital in the Concession.

178
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:38,200
We'll come back tonight.

179
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:39,820
Okay, let's go.

180
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:49,160
I'll go back to get some clean clothes.

181
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,000
See you at the church entrance later.

182
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,640
Okay.

183
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,280
I'll go in first, and you cover me from outside.

184
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,540
I'd better go with you.

185
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,280
No.

186
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:10,420
If anything happens, we can look out for each other.

187
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,760
Don't worry.

188
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,160
I have a surprise for you.

189
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,360
So beautiful.

190
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,080
Please let me go.

191
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,800
No!
